; A temporary verbatim copy of matrix's terminal core (matrix.ansi,
; matrix.text, matrix.grid and matrix.vte) at invariant-hq/mosaic
; (samoht/mosaic) 7d90dc4e. It exists because matrix 0.1.0 lacks those
; fixes, and it is deleted when vhs moves to matrix 0.2.0 (the next branch).
; Do not edit it: fix upstream instead. See README.md.
;
; The four upstream libraries are one wrapped library here, so that none of
; its modules clashes with matrix 0.1.0's Ansi, Grid, Glyph or Vte in a
; program that links both.

